[en.DECISION_STEAL_TECHNOLOGY]
Technology Stealing from §Y[FROM.GetName]§!

[en.DECISION_STEAL_TECHNOLOGY_desc]
Equestria is a land of freedom: freedom of ponies, freedom of creatures, freedom of thought as long as you don’t say it out loud, freedom of misappropriating neighbours’ ideas without permission or any understanding of copyright laws.

[en.DECISION_STEAL_TECHNOLOGY_TOOLTIP]
It is only allowed to steal from one country at a time.

[en.DECISION_STEAL_TECHNOLOGY_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
We will steal a random technology bonus from all technologies owned by §Y[FROM.GetName]§! but not us.
The more we know about §Y[FROM.GetName]§! in terms of intel, the more likely we are to steal a larger technology bonus.

[en.PIHC_STEALED_TECHNOLOGY]
Technology Stealing

[zh.DECISION_STEAL_TECHNOLOGY]
从§Y[FROM.GetName]§!窃取技术

[zh.DECISION_STEAL_TECHNOLOGY_desc]
小马利亚是一个自由的国度：小马们是自由的，其他生物也是自由的，思想也是自由的（只要你不大声说出来），对版权法一无所知并未经允许随意使用邻居的创意也是自由的。

[zh.DECISION_STEAL_TECHNOLOGY_TOOLTIP]
一次只能从一个国家窃取。

[zh.DECISION_STEAL_TECHNOLOGY_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
我们将从§Y[FROM.GetName]§!拥有但我们没有的所有科技中随机窃取一个科技加速。
我们对§Y[FROM.GetName]§!的整体情报掌握越多，我们窃取到更大的科技加速的可能性就越大。

[zh.PIHC_STEALED_TECHNOLOGY]
技术窃取
